@stop to-neutron
do: shot
to-radii: 10
sweep: 30
rise: 10
max-rate: 0.6
seconds: 6
caption: A sun's mass in twenty kilometres, spinning, its surface a trillion times denser than steel

@stop round-neutron
do: shot
to-radii: 3
sweep: 100
rise: 20
max-rate: 0.4
seconds: 5
caption: Its crust is iron nuclei in a lattice; beneath it, neutrons pressed together as in one nucleus

